    {"id": "accuracy", "label": "Vocabulary & accuracy", "descriptors": ["Use isolated words or patterns; errors often obscure meaning.", "Use relevant vocabulary; some errors affect meaning.", "Use varied appropriate language; errors rarely affect meaning.", "Use precise vocabulary and flexible structures with consistent control."]},
    {"id": "communication", "label": "Communicative effectiveness", "descriptors": ["Partially address the purpose; substantial clarification needed.", "Communicate the main message but omit a useful next step.", "Fulfil the purpose and give clear, workable next steps.", "Respond flexibly, justify choices and resolve uncertainty."]},
