    a["tasks"] = [task("arrival-reply", "Write the arrival reply", "In Chinese, write 140–220 characters to a guest arriving at 10 a.m. with a quiet-room request. For this fictional hotel, standard check-in is 3 p.m. and luggage storage is available. Acknowledge both requests, explain what is conditional, offer a clear next step and ask one useful question.", ["林女士，您好！感谢您…", "您可以先…，再…", "关于…，我们已记录，但…", "请问您是否…？"], "Offer a useful alternative while preserving guest choice. Explain why your wording avoids an unrealistic promise.", "林女士，您好！感谢您提前告知到店时间。我们通常下午三点开始办理入住。您上午十点到店后，可以先寄存行李，我们再为您确认房间是否准备好。提前入住及安静房间的安排都需要视当天的房态而定，目前还无法保证。我们已经记录您的需求，会尽力协调。如果暂时不能入住，您可以先到休息区等候。请问两位老人是否有需要提前告知我们的具体需求？"), task("arrival-roleplay", "At the reception desk", "With a partner acting as the guest, perform a 2-minute exchange. Confirm the reservation, clarify one need and explain a conditional arrangement. Save a short Chinese transcript or a reflection after speaking. This app does not record or recognize speech.", ["Ask the guest to clarify one detail.", "Paraphrase the request before offering a solution.", "Close by confirming the agreed next step."], "Your partner changes their request halfway through. Adapt without losing a professional tone.", "Receptionist: 请问我理解得对吗？您希望两间房都比较安静，而且最好能提前入住。Guest: 对，不过如果不能提前入住，我们可以先寄存行李。Receptionist: 好的，我先确认您的预订，再查看房态。", "roleplay", 50)]

