    b["tasks"] = [task("trip-proposal", "A guest-ready afternoon plan", "Use the fictional guest brief and Plan A to write a 160–240-character Chinese recommendation. Justify your choice using at least two constraints, give a sequence, explain a rain alternative, and ask one question before booking. Do not invent extra attractions or confirmed reservations.", ["根据您的预算和兴趣，我建议…", "与其…，不如…", "如果下雨，可以…", "预订前，请问…？"], "Discuss one limitation of your preferred option and offer a choice without pressure.", "根据您的预算和兴趣，我建议选择方案甲。每人七百泰铢，符合八百泰铢以内的预算；活动约三小时，不会占用整个下午。您可以先步行参观社区，再参加室内手工体验。与其把很多时间花在车上，不如在附近了解当地生活。如果下雨，我们可以减少户外部分，并先确认室内活动是否有空位。不过，方案甲仍需要步行约二十分钟。预订前，请问您对步行和手工体验有什么偏好？"), task("trip-pitch", "Make your recommendation", "Give a 90-second Chinese recommendation to a partner. Invite a question and revise one part of the plan. Save the final recommendation or your reflection.", ["State the recommendation first.", "Use details from the brief as evidence.", "Ask whether the proposal fits the guest's priorities."], "Respond when your partner says they dislike handicrafts.", "我推荐方案甲，主要因为它符合您的预算，而且乘车时间少。不过，手工体验是否适合您，还需要听听您的意见。", "roleplay", 50)]

